{
  "name": "Weekly Competitor Google Ads Spy (Apify -> Google Sheets)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Google Ads Transparency Competitor Spy (Apify -> Google Sheets)\n\nAutomatically tracks competitor creatives on Google Search, Display, and YouTube every Monday, drops incomplete rows, deduplicates by `adId`, and upserts clean creative metadata + preview URLs into Google Sheets.\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n- Set `APIFY_TOKEN` in n8n Environment Variables (Apify's free $5/month credit covers testing).\n- Connect a Google Sheets OAuth2 credential and replace `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID`.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 450,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Overview & Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [140, 20]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 1: Schedule & Competitor List\n\nEdit **Configure Competitors** to set target advertiser names, `maxAds` per brand, country `region` (`US`, `GB`, `anywhere`), or ad `format` (`any`, `TEXT`, `IMAGE`, `VIDEO`).",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-config",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 1 Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [160, 560]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 2: Scrape & Filter Ad Creatives\n\nCalls **67-labs/google-ads-transparency-center-scraper** on Apify, verifies each creative has an `adId` and `previewUrl`, and removes duplicates.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-extract",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 2 Scrape & Filter",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [680, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 3: Format & Upsert Ad Library\n\nNormalizes active regions, first/last shown dates, and image/preview URLs, then upserts by `adId` so weekly runs update existing ads cleanly.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-sheets",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 3 Format & Sync",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1280, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [1],
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "trigger-weekly",
      "name": "Weekly Monday Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [200, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "trigger-manual",
      "name": "Manual Test Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 460]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-advertisers",
              "name": "advertisers",
              "value": "={{ [\"Notion\", \"Linear\", \"HubSpot\"] }}",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-max",
              "name": "maxAds",
              "value": 30,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-region",
              "name": "region",
              "value": "US",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-format",
              "name": "format",
              "value": "any",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "configure-competitors",
      "name": "Configure Competitors",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [440, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/67-labs~google-ads-transparency-center-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "={{ $env.APIFY_TOKEN }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "maxTotalChargeUsd",
              "value": "1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ advertisers: $json.advertisers, maxAds: $json.maxAds, region: $json.region, format: $json.format, includeRegions: true }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "apify-ads",
      "name": "Scrape Google Ads Transparency (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [700, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-ad-id",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.adId || '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-preview-url",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.previewUrl || '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "filter-ads",
      "name": "Filter Valid Ads",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [940, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "removeDuplicateInputItems",
        "compare": "selectedFields",
        "fieldsToCompare": {
          "fields": [
            {
              "fieldName": "adId"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "dedupe-ad",
      "name": "Deduplicate by Ad ID",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1160, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "out-ad-id",
              "name": "adId",
              "value": "={{ $json.adId }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-adv-id",
              "name": "advertiserId",
              "value": "={{ $json.advertiserId || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-adv-name",
              "name": "advertiserName",
              "value": "={{ $json.advertiserName || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-format",
              "name": "format",
              "value": "={{ $json.format || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-first",
              "name": "firstShown",
              "value": "={{ $json.firstShown || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-last",
              "name": "lastShown",
              "value": "={{ $json.lastShown || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-regions",
              "name": "regionsText",
              "value": "={{ $json.regionsText || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-preview",
              "name": "previewUrl",
              "value": "={{ $json.previewUrl }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-image",
              "name": "imageUrl",
              "value": "={{ $json.imageUrl || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-scraped",
              "name": "scrapedAt",
              "value": "={{ $json.scrapedAt || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "format-ad",
      "name": "Format Competitor Ad Row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1380, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Sheet1",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": ["adId"]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sheets-upsert",
      "name": "Upsert Ads to Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1600, 320]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Weekly Monday Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Configure Competitors",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Manual Test Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Configure Competitors",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Configure Competitors": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Scrape Google Ads Transparency (Apify)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Scrape Google Ads Transparency (Apify)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Filter Valid Ads",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Filter Valid Ads": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Deduplicate by Ad ID",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    },
    "Deduplicate by Ad ID": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format Competitor Ad Row",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Format Competitor Ad Row": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Upsert Ads to Google Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
